  "description": "<p>Have you ever been running from a squad only to run right into a bush and die because you couldn’t sprint through it? Then this mod is for you. BushWhacker disables all bush and swamp slowdown effects, allowing you to sprint through them as if they don’t exist.</p>\n<p>This mod has been made standalone and is distributed with permission from the original author.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Link to original modpage: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/451/cwx-bushwhacker\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CWX BUSHWHACKER</a></li>\n<li>Link to original MegaMod: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1454/cwx-megamod\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CWX-MegaMod</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/9668/cwx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CWX’s profile page, click this link to show them some love!</a></p>\n",
